         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nIn the previous classes, we studied the model of the universe that we have today, based on the measurements made over the past centuries.\n\nIn this class, and in the next classes, we are going to look at the universe in the opposite direction: starting from the first moments after the Big Bang and moving toward the present. Along the way, we will learn about another mathematical operation: **division**.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
